      "title": "Hotel Wi-Fi claims Pangolin's domain",
      "explanation": "A hotel network claims all of zivkovic.me and its resolver serves a forged copy of the zone: every name points at the hotel's page and the Verification Record carries the correct token for the hotel's claim. Pangolin's device validates against the real DNSSEC chain (root, .me, Cloudflare) and rejects the claim; the hotel cannot produce Cloudflare's signatures.",
      "discovery": "dnr",
      "parent": "zivkovic.me",
      "network_resolvers": [
        {
          "adn": "dns.hotel.lab",
          "addr": "172.30.97.21:8853"
        }
